Understood. We'll update the architecture to use Jenkins for CI/CD and remove Amazon ECS with Fargate completely.

The updated architecture will use Docker containers deployed directly on Amazon EC2 instances. Jenkins will automate the build, Docker image creation, ECR push and deployment.

